          "date": "2026-11-23 01:55:00.000000000",
          "tz": 480
        },
        "subject": "LU-21180 fld: add kunit fld_cache_test",
        "message": "LU-21180 fld: add kunit fld_cache_test\n\nThe FLD sequence-range cache has no in-kernel unit coverage for\ninsert, lookup, delete and flush after the interval-tree rewrite.\n\nAdd a KUnit module that builds fld_cache.c in, so fld.ko does not\nneed to export the cache helpers.  It covers hits and misses at range\nedges, adjacent ranges, every kind of duplicate or overlapping insert,\nrejection of empty and wrapping ranges, ranges at the u64 limits,\nmany ranges inserted out of order and partly deleted, and hit/miss\nstatistics.\n\nAdd a HAVE_KUNIT configure check.  The module is built only when the\nkernel has KUnit enabled; otherwise the build goes on without it.\n\nAdd sanity test_55d to load the module and check the suite result.\nIt skips if the module was not built or KUnit is disabled.\n\nAdd lustre/kunit/ku to find and run the KUnit modules affected by\nthe changed files, using the KUNIT.list files.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nAssisted-by: Cursor:Composer ltvm\nAssisted-by: Augment:Opus5.5 ltvm\nSigned-off-by: Keguang Xu <kxu@ddn.com>\nChange-Id: I96df8b55c54ca4ea6e09748d74047633557792f1\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
